---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { Card } from "@meowerse/ui";
---
<Layout title="privacy · meowsenger">
  <div class="mw-prose">
    <h1>privacy policy</h1>
    <p>Meowsenger shares one privacy policy with every meowverse service: <a href="https://auth.alxnko.dev/privacy"><strong>read the full privacy policy</strong></a>.</p>

    <Card title="meowsenger in short">
      <ul>
        <li>Meowsenger has no accounts of its own: you sign in with your meowerse account.</li>
        <li>It keeps your messages, chats, memberships and read state until deleted, plus push subscriptions if you turn notifications on.</li>
        <li><strong>Not end-to-end encrypted:</strong> the server can read messages.</li>
        <li>Delete your Meowsenger data from <strong>settings, danger zone</strong>. Messages you already sent stay in their chats.</li>
        <li>No ads and no tracking across sites. Today there are no analytics either; see the full policy for the current state.</li>
      </ul>
    </Card>

    <p class="mw-muted">Questions or data requests: <a href="mailto:privacy@alxnko.dev">privacy@alxnko.dev</a>. See also the <a href="https://auth.alxnko.dev/terms">shared terms</a>.</p>
  </div>
</Layout>
